@startuml
title 6. Procesamiento de OCR

actor Inspector
participant Frontend
participant "OCR API\nPOST /api/v1/ocr/evidences/{evidence_id}/extract" as OcrExtractRoute
participant "ocrservice.extracttextfromevidence" as OcrService
participant "ocrservice.resolvefilepath" as FileResolver
participant "ocrservice.preprocessimage" as Preprocess
participant "PaddleOCR" as Paddle
participant "OCR API\nPOST /api/v1/ocr/inspections/{inspection_id}/validate" as OcrValidateRoute
participant "validationservice.validateinspectionocr" as ValidationService
database DB

Inspector -> Frontend: Solicita OCR de evidencia
Frontend -> OcrExtractRoute: POST /api/v1/ocr/evidences/{evidence_id}/extract
OcrExtractRoute -> OcrService: extracttextfromevidence(db, evidence_id)

OcrService -> DB: SELECT Evidence
DB --> OcrService: Evidence
OcrService -> FileResolver: resolvefilepath(evidence.filepath)
FileResolver --> OcrService: imagePath
OcrService -> Preprocess: preprocessimage(imagePath)
Preprocess --> OcrService: processedPath
OcrService -> Paddle: predict(processedPath)
Paddle --> OcrService: texts, scores

OcrService -> DB: UPDATE Evidence\nocrextractedtext,\nocrconfidence,\nocrprocessed=True,\nocrlastprocessedat
DB --> OcrService: Evidence actualizada
OcrService --> OcrExtractRoute: OCRExtractResponse
OcrExtractRoute --> Frontend: Texto OCR por evidencia

Frontend -> OcrValidateRoute: POST /api/v1/ocr/inspections/{inspection_id}/validate
OcrValidateRoute -> ValidationService: validateinspectionocr(db, inspection_id)
ValidationService -> DB: Cargar Inspection + fields + evidences
DB --> ValidationService: Datos de inspección

ValidationService -> ValidationService: Comparar manualvalue vs ocrvalue\ncalcular validationstatus,\nvalidationmessage,\nconfidence y finalvalue
ValidationService -> DB: UPDATE InspectionField(s)
DB --> ValidationService: Campos actualizados

ValidationService --> OcrValidateRoute: OCRValidationResponse
OcrValidateRoute --> Frontend: Resumen y resultados OCR
Frontend --> Inspector: Visualiza coincidencias y discrepancias

@enduml